    "description": "Discover delicious and naturally sweet Season's Choice Frozen Whole Strawberries from ALDI. With no added sugar and packed with vitamin C and fiber, this is a choice you can feel good about! Add frozen strawberries to a blender to make delicious fruit smoothies, frozen yogurt, strawberry milkshakes and more. Because they are frozen right after they are picked, the fresh taste you love is preserved until you are ready to enjoy. However you plan to prepare Frozen Whole Strawberries, shop at ALDI for affordable prices and high quality frozen produce.",
